{"about_the_game":"<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GLOBETROTTING 8-BIT STYLE JRPG SET IN 90s EARTH</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/extras/d06f70bf6ec576adf6cdedb49fa0b706.poster.avif?t=1743362913\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/extras/d06f70bf6ec576adf6cdedb49fa0b706.webm?t=1743362913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/extras/d06f70bf6ec576adf6cdedb49fa0b706.mp4?t=1743362913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Embark on an 8-bit style JRPG adventure to save Earth circa 199X using a distinctive party-based combat system. </strong><br><br>As the high school football team\u2019s star, Gio Zachary never thought he would find himself on a globetrotting adventure to save the world. <br><br>Through a series of strange events, Gio embarks on a journey exploring Earth\u2019s bizarre magical underworld to master the skills needed to defeat an evil corporation\u2019s plans of global domination. <br><br>Team up with colorful characters from around the world and see what discoveries and secrets you\u2019ll find on each continent.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BATTLE</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/extras/e5d419b3106740c3f119bbd30f254d5c.poster.avif?t=1743362913\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/extras/e5d419b3106740c3f119bbd30f254d5c.webm?t=1743362913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/extras/e5d419b3106740c3f119bbd30f254d5c.mp4?t=1743362913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Battle in a distinctive, fast-paced party-based combat system mixing real-time action and strategic commands.<br><br></li><li>Manage characters and their class-based abilities in various ways for a compelling and immersive battle experience. <br><br></li><li>Battle with hotkeys if you prefer fast action, or freeze time with the combat menu if you like a more turn-based-like experience. Or mix and match!<br><br></li><li>Utilize and reallocate your character\u2019s talent points to suit your playstyle, or adapt your strategies based on the challenges you encounter.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/extras/8eb99d9b30a3aabd17fe15bf36148bdf.poster.avif?t=1743362913\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/extras/8eb99d9b30a3aabd17fe15bf36148bdf.webm?t=1743362913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/extras/8eb99d9b30a3aabd17fe15bf36148bdf.mp4?t=1743362913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Travel to various cultural locations across the world, learn foreign languages and use local currency to purchase global cuisines that heal you and your party.<br><br></li><li>Freely explore fun and magic-infected places around the globe in (largely) the order you choose - from art museums in Brazil to haunted jazz clubs in New Orleans to casinos in China! <br><br></li><li>Meet other unforgettable characters while adventuring on a variety of optional, story-centered sidequests.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/extras/f02941fc2470bd00bf639035062039ba.poster.avif?t=1743362913\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/extras/f02941fc2470bd00bf639035062039ba.webm?t=1743362913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/extras/f02941fc2470bd00bf639035062039ba.mp4?t=1743362913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gio's History Project","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1699030/055bc96a24d0b3a2188588fa9eaae41aae80376b.jpg"},{"name":"The San Luis Obispo Incident","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1699030/51785fbbf3c22b572ccb76a6bc6a06c61e789a3c.jpg"},{"name":"Haunted by a Melody","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1699030/2d8069eb745cdf531111db8f0f9345c7f5090518.jpg"},{"name":"Tomb Raiders","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1699030/a2bfcb1714e968eeea6c43b8462eda5cc15beddf.jpg"},{"name":"Research and Development","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1699030/8b6345d002af7aea9f71de532536e0af39040566.jpg"},{"name":"Dinotown Blues","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1699030/ed5e29243b3602edbc6d6cbe8e18f161d616960c.jpg"},{"name":"A Whale of a Tale","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1699030/62c71d433d45e708fc9dd46740def2949dd99000.jpg"},{"name":"Continental Breakout","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1699030/e0f4a75d38e84675ae42fe342c9c7a0f0b7ff381.jpg"},{"name":"Nor the Race to the Swift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1699030/3b7d5c9ef485c072fff57fa6c66b742462b91003.jpg"},{"name":"See the Art In Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1699030/462a4467fe91d4417a0ffcc27d3b1797f24e14b2.jpg"}],"total":35},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1699030?t=1743362913","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1699030?t=1743362913","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743362913","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743362913","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2884130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GLOBETROTTING 8-BIT STYLE JRPG SET IN 90s EARTH</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/extras/d06f70bf6ec576adf6cdedb49fa0b706.poster.avif?t=1743362913\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/extras/d06f70bf6ec576adf6cdedb49fa0b706.webm?t=1743362913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/extras/d06f70bf6ec576adf6cdedb49fa0b706.mp4?t=1743362913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Embark on an 8-bit style JRPG adventure to save Earth circa 199X using a distinctive party-based combat system. </strong><br><br>As the high school football team\u2019s star, Gio Zachary never thought he would find himself on a globetrotting adventure to save the world. <br><br>Through a series of strange events, Gio embarks on a journey exploring Earth\u2019s bizarre magical underworld to master the skills needed to defeat an evil corporation\u2019s plans of global domination. <br><br>Team up with colorful characters from around the world and see what discoveries and secrets you\u2019ll find on each continent.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BATTLE</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/extras/e5d419b3106740c3f119bbd30f254d5c.poster.avif?t=1743362913\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/extras/e5d419b3106740c3f119bbd30f254d5c.webm?t=1743362913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/extras/e5d419b3106740c3f119bbd30f254d5c.mp4?t=1743362913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Battle in a distinctive, fast-paced party-based combat system mixing real-time action and strategic commands.<br><br></li><li>Manage characters and their class-based abilities in various ways for a compelling and immersive battle experience. <br><br></li><li>Battle with hotkeys if you prefer fast action, or freeze time with the combat menu if you like a more turn-based-like experience. Or mix and match!<br><br></li><li>Utilize and reallocate your character\u2019s talent points to suit your playstyle, or adapt your strategies based on the challenges you encounter.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699030/extras/8eb99d9b30a3aabd17fe15bf36148bdf.poster.avif?t=1743362913\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://